      {
        "name": "places/ChIJu2YNEMEBBDQRWa772rrEytU/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xGaVNraHRkekI0VWtsNFFtZFFiRFZTYlRoNU4xRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "1 年前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "Arca Society 位於於黃竹坑 the Arca 雅格酒店，打造出城市綠洲般的餐飲體驗。餐廳設有寬敞明亮的室內空間，以及舒適寫意的戶外用餐區，即使非酒店住客亦可於此享受度假時光。作為一間寵物友善酒店，Arca Society 亦歡迎毛孩一同前來，共度悠閒時光。\n\n全日餐單融合亞洲與西方風味，菜式設計別具心思。當中 炭烤安格斯特級牛扒 烤得恰到好處，嫩滑多汁。配上自家製香草牛油，以香草及檸檬為主調，清新醒胃，為肉類添上一抹平衡。黑椒煙燻牛肉漢堡 選用煙燻牛肉，肉香濃郁富層次，配料包括太陽蛋、大啡菇、炸洋蔥圈、車打芝士及紅蔥松露蛋黃醬，味道濃厚而不膩。配上香脆薯條，份量十足。\n\n無論是 staycation 的延伸體驗，或與摯友寵物共享寫意週末，Arca Society 都是不容錯過的美食之選。\n\nArca Society in the Arca Hotel offers a lush, urban oasis perfect for a relaxing dining experience. With its bright indoor space and breezy outdoor terrace, it’s open to both hotel guests and visitors — and is pet-friendly too! Highlights of their all-day menu include the Grilled US Angus Prime Striploin, tender and juicy, paired with house-made herb butter infused with lemon; and the Beef Pastrami Burger, rich and layered with a sunny-side up egg, portobello mushroom and red onion-truffle mayo. A perfect spot for a weekend treat or staycation meal.",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "originalText": {
